 class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-305803 alk.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/af/Spine_static-305803_alk.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"324\" height=\"488\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"324\" data-file-height=\"488\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3058\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9F%83%E9%87%8C%E5%85%8B\" title=\"埃里克\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9F%83%E9%87%8C%E5%85%8B\" title=\"埃里克\"><img alt=\"埃里克\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9F%83%E9%87%8C%E5%85%8B\" title=\"埃里克\">埃里克</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.6</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>非理性迷宫</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：305803</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">“伟大的埃里克圣骑士！在今天成功击败了红龙！”<br />酒馆的角落，一个矮人挺起了胸膛，颇为自得地讲述着。<br />“我闯入了龙的洞穴，与那条红龙搏斗了整整三天三夜，最后一不小心被龙吞进了肚子里！这怎么能够难住伟大的埃里克呢？我用斧头敲打着龙的肚子。最后，红龙认输了，恳求我从它的肚子里走出来！哈哈！埃里克获得了最终的胜利！”<br />“当然，那条龙因为消化不良，咒骂了一整个白天。但它的确是个有品位的家伙，尤其是它储藏的那些蜜酒——我带了些出来，你们要尝尝吗？”<br />“吹牛？我说的当然是真的，圣骑士的誓言牢不可破！你问为什么没有带金币出来？其实，后来我们遭遇了幽灵……”</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"305803\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305804.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/0d/Belonging-305804.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">定制矮人胡子<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Custom Dwarf Beard</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />149<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>能够增强勇武气概的胡子，无需梳理就可以保持整洁浓密的外观。<br />每一位矮人都把自己的胡子视为珍宝，对着它发笑的行径将被伟大战士视作最恶劣的挑衅。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305805.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3c/Belonging-305805.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">伟岸披风<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Cloak of Greatness</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />80<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>赤红如战火，热烈如鲜血，并且拥有契合战士身高的恰当长度。<br />一切都很完美，除了它“有概率使穿着者在挥舞武器时被裹住或绊倒”的附加诅咒。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305806.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/ca/Belonging-305806.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“背包”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Inventory\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />6<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>仔细规划物资与体力，明智地决定用哪些东西填满背包，这是每个优秀冒险者必须掌握的技巧。但如果你的力量足够大，或者携带品足够轻，那么带上一面盾牌、一条被击败的龙，甚至是一座被攻克的城堡也未尝不可。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AA%93%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8E%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%BC1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 誓言与加值1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AA%93%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8E%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%BC1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AA%93%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8E%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%BC1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AA%93%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8E%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%BC1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AA%93%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8E%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%BC1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AA%93%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8E%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%BC1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AA%93%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8E%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%BC1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AA%93%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8E%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%BC2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 誓言与加值2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AA%93%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8E%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%BC2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AA%93%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8E%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%BC2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AA%93%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8E%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%BC2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AA%93%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8E%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%BC2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AA%93%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8E%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%BC2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AA%93%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8E%E5%8A%A0%E5%80%BC2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">誓言与加值 <small style=\"color: grey\">Oaths and Bonuses</small></span></span>"}}